{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17330","headline":"送人使之江陵 · 权德舆","name":"送人使之江陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉招不辞远，捧檄利攸往。\n行役念前程，讌游睽旧赏。\n征轺星乍动，江信潮应上。\n烟水飞一帆，霜云摇五两。\n纷纷别袂举，切切离鸿响。\n後会杳何时，悠然劳梦想。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}